Python To-Do List App
A simple command-line based To-Do List application built using Python. This project allows users to input tasks and display them in an organized numbered list.
Features
Add multiple tasks dynamically
Store tasks in a list
Display tasks in a numbered format
Beginner-friendly Python project
python-internship/
│── main.py
│── todo.py
│── README.md
How It Works
User enters the number of tasks
Program takes input for each task
Tasks are stored in a list
Tasks are displayed using enumerate()
